BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (immediately. Commercial email must satisfy 15 U.S.C. ?7704, including truthful routing, identification requirements, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (postal address, and a working opt-out. Do not use automated promotional texts or prerecorded calls without) Tj ET
